        "Abstract": "Research in task-oriented dialog has been limited by the existence of only monolingual English datasets. We present MultiWOZ-X, a parallel corpus of task-oriented dialogs in four major languages. We evaluate cross-lingual transfer for dialog state tracking and response retrieval, showing that intermediate conversational specialization for target languages drastically improves sample efficiency in few-shot transfer."
